   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(4000)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>それまでは、その武器を使うウェポンは\n使用できません。注意してください。<ab(4000)><ed()>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6302#83",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": null,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(4000)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>ブレンパワードは出撃時の機嫌によって\n性能が大幅に変化します。<ab(4000)>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6302#84",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": null,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(1000)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>出撃時のアーマーが多い場合は、\n機嫌が良くなる確率が上がりますが、<ab(1000)>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6302#85",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": null,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(4000)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>アーマーが低い場合は、機嫌が悪くなる\n確率が上がります。<ab(4000)>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6302#86",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": null,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(4000)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>機嫌の良い状態でいてもらうため、\n可能な限り休ませることを心がけてください。<ab(4000)>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6302#87",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": null,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(4000)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>機嫌は出撃前のメニュー画面で\n確認することができます。<ab(4000)>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6302#88",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": null,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(4000)>",
    "<ed()>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>機嫌はミッションの度に変化するので、\n確認は怠らないようにしましょう。<ab(4000)><ed()>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6302#89",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": null,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(4000)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>Ｖ－ＭＡＸは、ユニットの各性能を\n大幅に上昇させる機能です。<ab(4000)>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6302#90",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": null,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(4000)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>アーマーが一定以下になると\n発動が可能になります。<ab(4000)>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6302#91",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": null,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(4000)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>発動中は、体当たりによる強襲攻撃が\n使用できます。<ab(4000)>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "ref": "m6302#92",
   "layer": "mission dialogue",
   "phase": null,
   "opens_new_window": false,
   "tokens": [
    "<sp(20)>",
    "<ab(4000)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 380,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 38,
   "jp": "<sp(20)>バーニアゲージが０になると解除され、\n数秒間行動不能になるのが欠点です。<ab(4000)>",
   "en": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
